sequenceDiagram
  participant TA as Transfer A to B
  participant GA as Account A grain
  participant GB as Account B grain
  participant TB as Transfer B to A
  TA->>GA: Debit
  TB->>GB: Debit
  GA->>GB: Credit, waits for its turn
  GB->>GA: Credit, waits for its turn
  Note over GA,GB: neither finishes its turn<br/>and both calls end in a timeout
